<section class="content-section" id="confidentiality">
    <div class="content-wrapper">
        <h2>Confidentiality and Your Protection</h2>

        <p>
            Your communication with us is treated with the highest respect and discretion.
            In cases involving the safety of a child or imminent danger to any person, we
            may be required by law to involve appropriate authorities.
        </p>

        <p>
            <strong>Your identity as a reporter is never disclosed to the person you
            reported.</strong> This is a hard policy with no exceptions. No community member
            shall face negative consequences for filing a report in good faith. If a report
            leads to the removal of another member's content, the reporter is not identified.
            If a report is found to be without merit, the reporter's account is not penalized.
        </p>

        <p>
            The only exception is demonstrably malicious false reporting, which may result
            in account review.
        </p>
    </div>
</section>

